Install hooks (run from repository root):

  git config core.hooksPath scripts/git-hooks

Pre-commit runs:
  1) ./mvnw test          (unit tests; integration group excluded by default)
  2) ./mvnw spotless:check (Google Java Format + import cleanup)

Optional full static analysis (slower; same as CI quality gate):

  ./mvnw -Pquality verify

See config/build/README for Checkstyle, PMD, JaCoCo, and SonarQube usage.

Fix formatting before commit:

  ./mvnw spotless:apply

Bypass (emergency only):

  SKIP_PRE_COMMIT=1 git commit ...
